-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414622}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "389aeeff-ffb8-5897-88a3-b12029287eb6" :question/math-academy-id "q-170808" :question/problem "$\\,$ $x$ is not positive, or $x$ is not odd.\n\nExpress the compound predicate above in symbolic form given the following predicates:\n\n- $P(x):$ $x$ is positive\n\n- $Q(x):$ $x$ is odd" :question/worked-solution "Let's break our sentence down into individual statements:\n\n- The sentence \"$x$ is not positive\" can be expressed symbolically as $¬P.$\n\n- The sentence \"$x$ is not odd\" can be expressed symbolically as $¬Q.$\n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as \n\n$$\n¬P∨¬Q.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198727 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198258 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "c65d0713-5b7a-5559-bef7-7b238edc29ab" :knowledge-point/title "Negating a Disjunction Using De Morgan's Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33932fee-9b84-5ac2-80a4-e379807a1d82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$b$ is odd" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414567} {:answer/id #uuid "ca9bf587-4c7b-5f5c-9cfb-ee93ff22f238" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$b$ is even" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414604}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca9bf587-4c7b-5f5c-9cfb-ee93ff22f238" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$b$ is even" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414604} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f9e3849-efb4-5220-9a4e-b78dd68376c5" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414623} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4d10d1