s that\n\n$$\n¬(A∨B)=¬A∧¬B.\n$$\n\nSo, the negation of \"$a$ is even or $b$ is odd\" is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}¬(a\\text{ is even or }b\\text{ is odd }) & ≡¬(a\\text{ is even }∨b\\text{ is odd }) \\\\  & ≡¬(a\\text{ is even })∧¬(b\\text{ is odd }) \\\\  & ≡a\\text{ is odd }∧b\\text{ is even } \\\\  & ≡a\\text{ is odd and }b\\text{ is even}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198728 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198258 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "c65d0713-5b7a-5559-bef7-7b238edc29ab" :knowledge-point/title "Negating a Disjunction Using De Morgan's Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "93afc464-42e5-5633-99c7-0f028f8681e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "b > 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186195007} {:answer/id #uuid "008e4162-54b4-5cf1-8297-576ba85caeb6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "b \\le 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186195008} {:answer/id #uuid "2d59d97b-8155-5800-9668-0c65a5c12b4b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "b \\ge 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186195009}] :answer-field/id #uuid "143a1d71-d773-5457-b1f2-3156084212ab" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186195006} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a2fbfe43-27c6-5d11-9108-6a228dd37822" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "or" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186195011} {:answer/id #uuid "3cf02772-3d95-5c50-a0c0-b9125b8110ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "and" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186195012}] :answer-field/id #uuid "53d6330f-59e6-5be0-b020-2923b8d7e01a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 